WEBVTT

00:14:28.023 --> 00:14:31.238
so in theory, Freya should go
down the line and not stop at all.

00:14:31.262 --> 00:14:32.726
And this is really important,

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:35.545
because we also need to know
people who are not infected,

00:14:35.569 --> 00:14:37.094
she needs to be able to do that.

00:14:37.118 --> 00:14:38.342
And this is a tough test.

00:14:38.366 --> 00:14:41.548
These socks have been in the freezer
for a couple of years now,

00:14:41.572 --> 00:14:44.392
and this is a tiny bit of a sock as well.

00:14:44.416 --> 00:14:47.514
So imagine if this was a whole person,
giving off a big signal.

00:14:47.538 --> 00:14:48.943
So this is really incredible.

00:14:48.967 --> 00:14:50.425
OK, over to you, Mark.

00:14:57.538 --> 00:14:58.689
(Laughs)

00:14:58.713 --> 00:14:59.714
(Applause)

00:14:59.738 --> 00:15:02.276
Brilliant. Fantastic.